From 5d14f4d33a667ea0bb8c5f946056f38e89b1e5e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 17:53:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 20/22] Optimize FP8 Wave Split-K

- Add N-specialized two-stage FP8 kernels
- Select splits per shape and architecture
- Use packed gfx90a FP8 conversion
- Reuse LDS data across wider gfx90a blocks
- Specialize the 16-split reduction path
- Preserve legacy and graph-safe workspace use
- Extend CDNA and RDNA validation coverage

Tools used:
- Cursor: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
